	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 54526,
	"Name": "Kenneth's Custom Shops - SDV Style - Small Version (No Text Sign)",
	"Author": "Kf29",
	"AuthorLabel": "Kenneth",
	"Description": "[size=4][b]What is this?[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]This pack gives your custom shops a classic SDV Style (Small Version) exterior. Wooden buildings with colorful striped awnings, wooden signs with bread, cupcakes, drinks, and fruits, plus flower boxes and crates. Vanilla-friendly and fits perfectly in Stardew Valley. No new items, no new content.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Includes SDV Style (Small Version) for 10 shops:[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Bakery[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Dessert Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Drink Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Fruit Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Grocery Store[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Restaurant[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Seed Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Vegetable Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Fastfood Restaurant[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Japanese Restaurant[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]You do not need to download all 10. If you only use Bakery and Dessert Shop, download only those two.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]You must have the original shop mod installed. This skin pack alone will not work.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]What is inside each zip?[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Each zip contains one folder, for example Kenneth's Bakery, with:[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• assets / KennethsBakery.png[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• content.json[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]How to use (Mobile and PC)[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]1. Download the original shop mod.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]2. Download the SDV Style (Small Version) skin with the same name.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]3. Merge the skin folder into the original mod folder and overwrite when asked.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Only the building image and content.json will be replaced. Other files will stay.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Notes[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Visual change only. No gameplay changes.[/b][/size]",
